<title>INDIA: HOCKEY-WOMEN'S INDIRA GANDHI GOLD CUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-WOMEN'S INDIRA GANDHI GOLD CUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the Indira Gandhi</p>
<p>Gold Cup women's hockey tournament on Wednesday:</p>
<p>India beat Australia 3-0 (halftime 3-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Sita Gussain 22, Pritam Thakran 29, Sandeep Kaur</p>
<p>34.</p>
